ncnn-Vulkan sidecars (optional, not shipped in the product bundle)
==================================================================

Waifu2x (ncnn/Vulkan port)
--------------------------
Project: waifu2x-ncnn-vulkan
Upstream: https://github.com/nihui/waifu2x-ncnn-vulkan
License: MIT (see upstream repository)
Original waifu2x: https://github.com/nagadomi/waifu2x
Models: CUnet weights from the upstream release zip (`models-cunet/`).
Verify model licenses before redistribution.

Real-CUGAN (ncnn/Vulkan port)
-----------------------------
Project: realcugan-ncnn-vulkan
Upstream: https://github.com/nihui/realcugan-ncnn-vulkan
License: MIT (see upstream)
Original Real-CUGAN: https://github.com/bilibili/ailab/tree/main/Real-CUGAN
Models: `models-se`, `models-pro`, `models-nose` from the upstream release zip.

ncnn
----
Upstream: https://github.com/Tencent/ncnn
License: BSD 3-Clause (see upstream)

These binaries and weights are downloaded by scripts/fetch-waifu2x.sh and
scripts/fetch-realcugan.sh into this directory. They are not part of the
macOS app bundle as of v0.4.0.
